Z||000005||GT-maniac||06-22-2001||08:55 PM||||Tremclad is your basic garden variety rust paint. It doesn't need primer. Great for metal but maybe not so good on plastics. It's available pretty much everywhere up here so it may be a Canadian thing.||||reg||1
